  "slug": "claude-performance",
  "name": "Claude Performance",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Self-improving measurement layer for Claude Code. Reads JSONL session data, computes effectiveness metrics, writes behavioral rules into CLAUDE.md.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **1 skill**, **1 hook** and **1 MCP server**.\n\n- **Skills** (1): `performance` (Use this skill when the user says /performance, /digest, asks for a weekly Claude performance report, or wants…)\n- **Hooks** (1): `SessionStart`\n- **MCP servers** (1): `.mcp.json`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install claude-performance@claude-community` from `adelaidasofia/claude-performance`.",
